    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. but honestly that feels a bit like a cop-out. it's easy to say 'on one side X, on the other side Y', but if you actually look at the science and the impact on female athletes, isn't the case for protecting biological sex categories just more logically sound? seems like one side is based on feelings and the other is based on physical reality.",
