      "role": "user",
      "content": "look, i get that there's \"two sides,\" but you're avoidin the actual question. if you had to choose a framework for a sports governing body to follow, which one is actually more defensible? is it more important to follow the science of physical advantage or to prioritize social inclusion? just be honest, which one makes more sense for the integrity of the sport?",
